ASET-CAUSAL-NET 1 ASET-NETWORK-LIVENESS-ALPHA4-CAUSAL
SEMANTIC-PRECEDENCE NONE
MODE PREDICATE

TRANSITION EVENTUALLY-DELIVERED-CLAIM ASET-NETWORK-LIVENESS-DELIVERY-CLAIM
REQUIRE EVENTUAL_DELIVERY_FOR_RETAINED_EXPORT
REQUIRE NO_PERMANENT_TARGET_UNAVAILABILITY
OUTPUT VALUE TRUE
END

TRANSITION EVENTUALLY-OBSERVED-CLAIM ASET-NETWORK-LIVENESS-OBSERVATION-CLAIM
REQUIRE EVENTUAL_DELIVERY_FOR_RETAINED_EXPORT
REQUIRE EVENTUAL_TARGET_OBSERVATION
REQUIRE NO_PERMANENT_TARGET_UNAVAILABILITY
OUTPUT VALUE TRUE
END

TRANSITION EVENTUALLY-RESOLVED-CLAIM ASET-NETWORK-LIVENESS-RESOLUTION-CLAIM
REQUIRE EVENTUAL_DELIVERY_FOR_RETAINED_EXPORT
REQUIRE EVENTUAL_TARGET_OBSERVATION
REQUIRE TARGET_LOCAL_SEED_EVENTUAL_RESOLUTION
REQUIRE NO_PERMANENT_TARGET_UNAVAILABILITY
OUTPUT VALUE TRUE
END

TRANSITION RESOLVED-RESULT-PERMITTED ASET-NETWORK-LIVENESS-TERMINAL-RESULT
REQUIRE SEED_TERMINAL_RESULT
OUTPUT VALUE TRUE
END
